    a: 'Pay depends on the path and the college. Top National Law Universities report median packages in the range of Rs 16 to 21 lakh for placed students, while typical litigation, media and BA-level roles start far lower. The regular salaried wage in India is about Rs 2.2 to 2.9 lakh a year on average (PLFS 2025), so the useful question is what proof and skill will lift you above it.',
