      <div class="gate">
        <span class="gate__num">Gate 2</span>
        <span class="gate__name">Proof of communication</span>
        <p>A one-to-two-minute explanation of why this path suits you, in words your family can follow.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="gate">
        <span class="gate__num">Gate 3</span>
        <span class="gate__name">Proof of value</span>
        <p>Feedback from three people working in that field on what is still missing.</p>
